        <mxCell id="dns-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Forward both zones.&lt;/b&gt; The CNAME target lives in ts.eventgrid.azure.net, so the site resolver must forward that zone to the hub as well; otherwise the device resolves the namespace's public address.&lt;br&gt;Public side: Cloudflare delegates iot.example.com to the Azure DNS public zone (TXT _eg.mqtt, CNAME ops, TXT _dnsauth.ops)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1B1B1B;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
